          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धरणो (dharṇo) is inherited from Sanskrit dharati, \"holds, keeps\"; CDIAL lists Marwari dharṇo, \"to keep, place\" (CDIAL 6747)."
